# How recipes/omarchy differs from upstream; bin/rebase-recipe re-applies it to each new
# upstream release (see its --help for the format, NOTES.md for the why).
# The patches are the omarchy-asus fork's fixes backported onto the pinned release
# (fork branch asus/v4-0-5). recipes/omarchy and recipes/omarchy-settings carry the
# SAME patch list: both packages build from the same source tree, and omarchy pins
# omarchy-settings=$pkgver. Keep the two DELTA files in lockstep.
# prepare() doesn't cd into the source, hence the "omarchy" directory argument.
